{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>今日（19日）下午4時39分，據報3名男子騎單車由西沙GO PARK出發，擬前往深涌營地；途至深涌碼頭附近時，其中一名姓戴（71歲）老翁，懷疑暈倒從單車跌下，不省人事。</p><p>政府飛行服務隊派出直升機，協助將事主送往東區醫院搶救。醫院可見，事主須戴上氧氣罩、左邊眼角有傷。據了解，戴翁有身體病患紀錄；警方現正調查事件。</p><figure><img alt=\"男事主抵院時需戴上氧氣罩。（梁偉權攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261119/1200150867584487424832567.jpeg/WoYHdNUEbJNYqtQhfZPYd0a76OxB1AYJLAFQxjoBUMY\"/><figcaption>男事主抵院時需戴上氧氣罩。（梁偉權攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"男事主抵院時需戴上氧氣罩。（梁偉權攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261119/1200150918260068352897361.jpeg/jSQxO3s_PDZ8iZQW2aYg1FoT-Ej7eQ0RtGmel6Jpnpc\"/><figcaption>男事主抵院時需戴上氧氣罩。（梁偉權攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"男事主抵院時需戴上氧氣罩，左眼角有傷。（梁偉權攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261119/1200155294693330944836704.jpeg/HcKh5SWon40vvoRDWY_69W2Twac4zi3ELkOFwgdDhcI\"/><figcaption>男事主抵院時需戴上氧氣罩，左眼角有傷。（梁偉權攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"男事主抵院時需戴上氧氣罩。（梁偉權攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261119/1200151010794803200541920.jpeg/d5KdxwUji4I6QYSG45o2qP3JSf-miEYpL5z0Jzmc9Cc\"/><figcaption>男事主抵院時需戴上氧氣罩。（梁偉權攝）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T12:37:10.184526+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":242,"images":4,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T10:33:57+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-19T12:30:38.860040+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-19T12:30:38.860040+00:00","content_hash":"7ed16c3a6727685780641147134187ceb92a0a680a3b48a6287b4562c9f663a9","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}